// The owner's agents-and-models settings contract (docs/DESIGN.md D-212,
// D-205, D-206).
//
// Agents and models are off by default, behind one switch with a toggle for
// each feature: the Ask box's model (D-203), the maintainer (D-204) and the
// MCP server (D-213). The owner also names, per role, the primary model and
// its fallbacks as "provider/model" references (D-205), and per data tier
// the models allowed to receive it (D-206). Only the owner changes them.
//
